No third-party code is included in this repository.  `lant install-external` downloads and builds, from their
own repositories, programs that keep their own licenses:

- DSurfTomo (https://github.com/HongjianFang/DSurfTomo): MIT License, Copyright (c) 2017 Hongjian Fang
- pDSurfTomo (https://github.com/zshang825/pDSurfTomo): GNU General Public License v3

lant/_external/fwd1d.f90 is linked against the DSurfTomo sources at build time.
